Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Papai...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é... O que diabos é você?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.93,0:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquilo era uma bruxa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Um monstro que devora o coração \N das pessoas de dentro para fora.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.06,0:00:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem o poder de batalhar contra as bruxas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu posso trazer esse poder à tona.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois bem, o que você quer fazer?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Matar...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.58,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Matar bruxas!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.37,0:01:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Foi mal, Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As bruxas são as únicas...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As bruxas são as únicas que eu nunca...
